<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We may collect the following information when you browse our store, create an account, or place an order:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Name, phone number, email address, and delivery address</li>
    <li>Order details, payment method, and billing information</li>
