<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>3. How we use your information</h2>
  <p>We use your information to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Process, pack, and deliver your orders</li>
    <li>Share order updates and respond to support requests</li>
    <li>Improve our website, products, and customer experience</li>
    <li>Send order confirmations and, where you have opted in, promotional updates</li>
    <li>Prevent fraud and keep our store secure</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>4. Sharing your information</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell your personal information. We only share it with trusted partners who help us run the store, such as
