    services to Sanoozy.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>5. Cookies and tracking</h2>
  <p>
    Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to remember your preferences, keep items in your cart, and
    understand how visitors use the store. You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may
    affect some store features.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>6. Data security</h2>
  <p>
    We take reasonable steps to protect your information from loss, misuse, or unauthorized access. While no online
    service is completely secure, we work to keep your data safe and only retain it for as long as needed to fulfill
    orders, meet legal requirements, and improve our service.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>7. Your choices</h2>
  <p>You may request to review, update, or delete your personal information, or unsubscribe from marketing messages, by contacting us. If you have a customer account, you can also update some details from My Profile.</p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>8. Updates to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The latest version will always be available on this page, with
